      "innerHTML": "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"/#organization\",\"name\":\"terui Health care\"},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"/#website\",\"url\":\"https://teruicare.com\",\"name\":\"terui Health care\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"@id\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/68c1536f91f1bf8bc2347d1e_Glow-1.jpg\",\"url\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/68c1536f91f1bf8bc2347d1e_Glow-1.jpg\",\"width\":\"1536\",\"height\":\"1024\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"ItemPage\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#webpage\",\"url\":\"/product/glow-70mg/\",\"name\":\"Glow 70mg (R&amp;D Only) - Terui Health care\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-11-25T18:28:16+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-28T08:23:38+00:00\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/68c1536f91f1bf8bc2347d1e_Glow-1.jpg\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Glow 70mg (R&amp;D Only) - Terui Health care\",\"description\":\"Each Glow 70mg Research kit includes: 2 \\u00d7 Pre-filled Research pens (Each pen contains 5mg BPC-157, 5mg TB-500, 25mg GHK-Cu)\",\"category\":\"Uncategorized\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#webpage\"},\"image\":[{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/68c1536f91f1bf8bc2347d1e_Glow-1.jpg\",\"height\":\"1024\",\"width\":\"1536\"}],\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4.75\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"ratingCount\":\"12\",\"reviewCount\":\"12\"},\"review\":[{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-646\",\"description\":\"Ordering Glow 70mg was daunting for me, and I hesitated due to prior online mishaps. However, my experience with Terui Healthcare was outstanding! My order arrived swiftly, and I\\u2019m seriously impressed with the results for my skin. This experience has reassured me about online health product purchases!\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-16 18:02:54\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Benjamin Taylor\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-641\",\"description\":\"I approached the idea of ordering Glow 70mg online with skepticism. What if it didn\\u2019t work? However, Terui Healthcare has changed my opinion. The product quality exceeded my expectations, and I\\u2019ve seen fantastic results for my skin within just a few weeks. It\\u2019s worth every penny\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-16 17:40:53\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Natalie Carter\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-588\",\"description\":\"I was skeptical about ordering online but took a plunge by getting Glow 70mg from Terui Healthcare. The process was easier than I anticipated. When the product arrived, I was thrilled with the quality. I began noticing results within a week, which significantly boosted my confidence in ordering online.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 10:35:53\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Lucas Wright\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-583\",\"description\":\"I had my doubts when ordering Glow 70mg for the first time online. It felt risky, but the positive reviews about Terui Healthcare eased my concerns. The straightforward process and quick shipping made it easy. I noticed results almost immediately; my skin's appearance has transformed! This was a great decision, and I\\u2019ll keep shopping here\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 10:15:43\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Mary Hall\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-576\",\"description\":\"My first experience ordering Glow 70mg was filled with doubt, especially since I\\u2019m cautious about health supplements. The website reassured me with detailed info, so I took the chance. When my order arrived, everything was well-packaged, and I started to see results almost immediately. My skin feels and looks better than ever! I am no longer skeptical and will order again!\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 08:48:15\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Emily White\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-569\",\"description\":\"I\\u2019ve always been cautious about ordering health products online. After reading reviews about Terui Healthcare, I decided to try their Glow 70mg. The website made it easy to find what I needed, and I appreciated their transparency about ingredients. When my order arrived on time, I was impressed. The product efficacy exceeded my expectations; my skin looks healthier and more radiant. This experience has made me a loyal customer!\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 08:16:00\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rebecca Adams\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-563\",\"description\":\"I just placed a bulk order for the Glow 70mg. To be sincere and straightforward! I got an excellent discount, and I can't wait to see results for my team\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 07:16:31\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Dr Jennifer Wilson\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-558\",\"description\":\"I have been purchasing the Glow series regularly.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 06:48:27\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Laura Chen\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-556\",\"description\":\"After a long wait, my Terui haul finally touched down, and I couldn't be happier with the vibrant colors and the durable feel of the materials used in these designs.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 05:14:21\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Pippa Chrystal\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-555\",\"description\":\"Obsessed is an understatement. Received my order and it\\u2019s safe to say I\\u2019ll be a repeat customer\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-13 05:06:44\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Marie Hindry\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-550\",\"description\":\"It exceeded my expectations. My skin feels healthier, and I noticed improvements within a week.\\\"\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-03-12 23:51:15\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Jane Smith\"}},{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#li-comment-263\",\"description\":\"Excelente\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-02-12 01:41:10\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":\"5\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Samary damas silva\"}}],\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"89.99\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-12-31\",\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\",\"itemCondition\":\"NewCondition\",\"url\":\"/product/glow-70mg/\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"/\",\"name\":\"terui Health care\",\"url\":\"https://teruicare.com\",\"logo\":\"\"}},\"@id\":\"/product/glow-70mg/#richSnippet\"}]}"
